    <item>
      <title>Driving Sustainable Manufacturing Through Circular Economy Practices</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/news/comork-leads-customers-to-implement-low-carbon-manufacturing-with-industrial-recycling-services/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/news/comork-leads-customers-to-implement-low-carbon-manufacturing-with-industrial-recycling-services/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Embracing Circular Economy in Precision Machinery 
    &lt;div id=&#34;embracing-circular-economy-in-precision-machinery&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#embracing-circular-economy-in-precision-machinery&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KO-YAN Precision Machinery (COMORK), situated in the heart of Taiwan&amp;rsquo;s precision machinery cluster, distinguishes itself through a commitment to sustainable manufacturing and circular economy principles. Leveraging over two decades of expertise in precision machining, the company places a strong emphasis on user experience in equipment research and development, offering tangible benefits to the industry.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Innovations in Cylindrical Grinding for Medium-Sized Workpieces</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/news/timtos-2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/news/timtos-2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Innovations in Cylindrical Grinding for Medium-Sized Workpieces 
    &lt;div id=&#34;innovations-in-cylindrical-grinding-for-medium-sized-workpieces&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#innovations-in-cylindrical-grinding-for-medium-sized-workpieces&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-00dd0c0c6fe6778ba14ea78bf1b01fb4&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/ex3-1_8751292761506525353.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;COMORK GO350-G2 and GJ-412 CNC at TIMTOS 2025&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;COMORK GO350-G2 and GJ-412 CNC at TIMTOS 2025&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/ex3-2_14390086390231046219.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Visit COMORK Booth No.Q0804 at TIMTOS 2025&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Visit COMORK Booth No.Q0804 at TIMTOS 2025&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The GO-33 is a CNC universal cylindrical grinding machine designed for both individual and batch production of medium-sized workpieces. It is particularly well-suited for general, external, internal, and irregular round grinding applications.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
